#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/src/logo.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.logo.logo:43
msgid ""
"Width or height of the GMT logo. Since the aspect ratio is fixed, only one "
"of the two can be specified. [Default is 2 inches wide and 1 inch high]."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/src/logo.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.logo.logo:46
msgid ""
"Draw a background box behind the logo. If set to ``True``, a simple "
"rectangular box is drawn using :gmt-term:`MAP_FRAME_PEN`. To customize the "
"box appearance, pass a :class:`pygmt.params.Box` object to control style, "
"fill, pen, and other box properties."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/src/logo.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.logo.logo:51
msgid ""
"Control what is written beneath the map portion of the logo.  - "
"``\"standard\"``: The text label \"The Generic Mapping Tools\". - "
"``\"no_label\"``: Skip the text label. - ``\"url\"``: The URL to the GMT "
"website."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/src/logo.py:docstring
